<title>USA: ExpressPoint Technology IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>ExpressPoint Technology IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering in ExpressPoint Technology Services was postponed, lead underwriter Rodman &amp; Renshaw said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Burnsville, Minnesota-based company had proposed to offer two million shares at an estimated price range of $8 to $10, according to a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>Expresspoint had planned to acquire two technology support service companies, Amcom and Delta Parts, to create a platform from which to launch an international company, the filing said.</p>
